      "description": "Confirms receipt of one existing alert. This alert applies to any component in one project. Acknowledging an alert prevents successive notifications. You receive an alert when a monitored component meets or exceeds a value you set until you acknowledge the alert. Use the Return All Alerts from One Project endpoint to retrieve all alerts to which the authenticated user has access.\n\nThis resource remains under revision and may change.",
